<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss May unemployment rate drops to 5.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Swiss May unemployment rate drops to 5.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's unemployment rate stood at 5.3 percent in May, down from April's 5.5 percent, the Federal Office of Trade, Industry and Labour said.</p>
<p>					  May 1997   Apr 1997   May 1996</p>
<p> Pct of workforce unemployed    5.3 pct    5.5 pct    4.5 pct</p>
<p> Number of jobless		  192,091    197,732    162,377</p>
<p> Job vacancies			10,870     9,861	6,272</p>
</text>
